{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A boy named Nero, born from a mysterious portal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To him, the girl named Snoa, who was always by his side, meant everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But one day, a sudden catastrophe twisted the world, leaving Nero completely alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now, in a realm swallowed by darkness, he begins a perilous journey to find her.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u201cFind her.\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/Info1.gif?t=1750187226\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as Nero, a boy chasing after the traces of Snoa.<br>Through the ruins of a broken world, memories of their time together resurface.<br>The magic and cloak she left behind will guide you through the dangers ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u201cIf they see you, you die.\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/Info2.gif?t=1750187226\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This world is filled with towering, grotesque beings with twisted movements.<br>The moment they detect you, there is no resistance\u2014only disappearance.<br>Stay hidden. Only the shadows can keep you safe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u201cRun if you want to live.\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/Info3.gif?t=1750187226\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hiding isn't always enough.<br>If you're spotted, your only choice is to run.<br>Leap, dodge, and scramble past obstacles to reach safety\u2026 if it still exists.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u201cDestroy the heart of the Transcendents.\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/Info4.gif?t=1750187226\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These entities\u2014called Transcendents\u2014rule over this broken world with overwhelming presence.<br>If you face them, you will die.<br>But for some unknown reason, you awaken in a hidden dimension housing their heart.<br>Gain mysterious powers, destroy the structures guarding the heart, and bring them down.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u201cUncover the truth.\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/Info5.gif?t=1750187226\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Why did they destroy this world?<br>What is the true nature of the power Nero has gained?<br>And where\u2026 is Snoa now?<br>Piece together the clues, discover the truth, and find her again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Whatever awaits\u2026 keep moving.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3450900?t=1750187226","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750187226","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/a3984f65a92a8c7a3b44c16738f7c008936a406d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750187226","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/a3984f65a92a8c7a3b44c16738f7c008936a406d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750187226","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>NOTICE</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/Roadmap.png?t=1750187226\" /></div><br>\ud83d\udea7 We're preparing a more polished and stable demo for Steam in <strong>September.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Look forward to new gameplay during <strong>Steam Next Fest this October</strong>!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A boy named Nero, born from a mysterious portal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To him, the girl named Snoa, who was always by his side, meant everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But one day, a sudden catastrophe twisted the world, leaving Nero completely alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now, in a realm swallowed by darkness, he begins a perilous journey to find her.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u201cFind her.\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/Info1.gif?t=1750187226\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as Nero, a boy chasing after the traces of Snoa.<br>Through the ruins of a broken world, memories of their time together resurface.<br>The magic and cloak she left behind will guide you through the dangers ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u201cIf they see you, you die.\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/Info2.gif?t=1750187226\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This world is filled with towering, grotesque beings with twisted movements.<br>The moment they detect you, there is no resistance\u2014only disappearance.<br>Stay hidden. Only the shadows can keep you safe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u201cRun if you want to live.\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/Info3.gif?t=1750187226\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hiding isn't always enough.<br>If you're spotted, your only choice is to run.<br>Leap, dodge, and scramble past obstacles to reach safety\u2026 if it still exists.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u201cDestroy the heart of the Transcendents.\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/Info4.gif?t=1750187226\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These entities\u2014called Transcendents\u2014rule over this broken world with overwhelming presence.<br>If you face them, you will die.<br>But for some unknown reason, you awaken in a hidden dimension housing their heart.<br>Gain mysterious powers, destroy the structures guarding the heart, and bring them down.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u201cUncover the truth.\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/Info5.gif?t=1750187226\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Why did they destroy this world?<br>What is the true nature of the power Nero has gained?<br>And where\u2026 is Snoa now?<br>Piece together the clues, discover the truth, and find her again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Whatever awaits\u2026 keep moving.</strong></p>","developers":["Black Cheeze"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/b762d860d2dee3a127965a8e6696c1357481e187/header.jpg?t=1750187226","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257133205,"mp4":{